744	# either a REQ-NNN trace or a Global-scope declaration -- and both spellings in
745	# use (`| AC-023 | Global |` and `| AC-035 (Global) | - |`) are read here. Only
746	# the first cell and the trace cell of the criterion's own defining row are
747	# consulted, and the first matching row decides; an AC id mentioned in prose or
748	# in another criterion's text is never a declaration of scope.
749	function Test-AcScopedGlobal([string]$Id, [string[]]$Lines) {
750	  foreach ($rawLine in $Lines) {
